   "name": "The Fall",
   "data": {
    "name": "The Fall",
    "description": "The heading is spent when the run starts. Health and chakra carry from fight to fight with no refills, and a lost fight ends the run.\nAfter the break, leave with what you hold or climb to the helm; lose there and you keep only what you held.\n\nThe Wayfinder's last heading is not a route through the ship. It is the night the ship came down, as the Core still replays it: fire on every deck, the hull breaking, and the Core cracking open at the heart of it all. Follow the heading, and you are aboard for the fall.\n\nClaim any reward choice still waiting from an earlier run before you set out.",
    "image": "https://ui0arpl8sm.ufs.sh/f/TbXxKOMraB0S2Y5J6gXab.webp",
    "questType": "battlepyramid",
    "questRank": "S",
    "successDescription": "You were aboard for the fall, and walked away from it.",
    "retryDelay": "none",
    "attemptDelay": "none",
    "consecutiveObjectives": true,
    "hidden": true,
    "requiredLevel": 1,
    "maxLevel": 100,
