      {
       "id": "d_aboard",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "The heading drops you onto the open deck at night. The sky is wrong: too low, too fast, the coast rushing up out of the dark. Somewhere below, a powder store has caught, and the fire is walking up through the planks.<br><br>A Deck Warden is still counting buckets.",
       "sceneBackground": "https://ui0arpl8sm.ufs.sh/f/Hzww9EQvYURJcoxkatSnxBpQqGNDcTHbLmYz8uXAl3oa54ti",
       "sceneCharacters": [],
