       "drawDescription": "The fight stalls, and the chart's way closes.",
       "fleeDescription": "You break away, and the way back closes behind you."
      },
      {
       "id": "d_gundeck",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "The Warden goes down in the smoke, still counting.<br><br>The gun deck is full of it. At the powder magazine the Arsenal Keeper stands in the fire with his ledger open, logging every keg as it goes up. \"Powder. Spent,\" he writes. \"Spent. Spent.\" The fire is coming from him.",
       "sceneBackground": "https://ui0arpl8sm.ufs.sh/f/Hzww9EQvYURJ0pHtoKgrYldRWJcD6vE10SjNsXHeA9pVMfQi",
