      {
       "id": "d_landing",
       "task": "dialog",
       "description": "The Core Horror sags into the burning water and goes still. For one moment, the fall stops.<br><br>Above you, through the smoke, the helm is still lit. The Captain is at the wheel, holding the heading straight into the shore, as he did that night. He has not let go yet.<br><br><b>Get off now and keep everything you hold. Climb to the helm and win, and the haul grows. Lose and you keep only what you hold now.</b>",
       "sceneBackground": "https://ui0arpl8sm.ufs.sh/f/Hzww9EQvYURJTdaBvI5IU29dZYJPoOKSh5vmlqatMub3EigH",
